		{"id":"dns","type":"text","text":"**Route 53 + ACM**\nper-tenant domains","x":160,"y":-890,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"alb","type":"text","text":"**ALB + WAF**\nTLS termination","x":500,"y":-890,"width":280,"height":100},
		{"id":"idp","type":"text","text":"## Identity Provider\nKeycloak (OIDC)\n**1 person = 1 account** across every product","x":160,"y":-630,"width":380,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"authsvc","type":"text","text":"### Auth service\ntoken exchange · sessions\napp-level roles","x":580,"y":-630,"width":340,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"config","type":"text","text":"### Config & Feature flags\nper-tenant rollout rings","x":1380,"y":-630,"width":320,"height":120},
		{"id":"cpdb","type":"text","text":"**Control-plane DB**\nsingle · not per-tenant","x":1740,"y":-630,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"notes","type":"text","text":"## Practices this model assumes\n\n1. **Tenant context** flows end-to-end: gateway → JWT claim → MDC → Hibernate tenant resolver → correct DataSource\n2. **Expand–contract migrations** — never a breaking schema change in one release\n3. **Migration runner is a pipeline stage**, fanning Flyway across 100 DBs in parallel with per-tenant version tracking\n4. **Automated tenant onboarding**: create DB → migrate → seed → register → DNS/cert → smoke test\n5. **Rollout rings**: UAT → 1 pilot tenant → 10% → all\n6. **Contract tests** (Pact / Spring Cloud Contract) between every service pair\n7. **Resilience4j**: timeouts, retries with jitter, circuit breakers, bulkheads\n8. **Terraform** for RDS, ECS/EKS, S3, IAM, DNS\n9. **Tested restores** — an untested backup is not a backup\n\n## Still open\n- Auth vs gateway: which is the real front door\n- How many services to launch with\n- Kafka vs RabbitMQ\n- ECS Fargate vs EKS\n- MySQL → PostgreSQL cutover strategy","x":2200,"y":-960,"width":420,"height":900,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ai","type":"text","text":"### AI Agent\nPython · FastAPI\nconsumes platform APIs\nshared by many apps","x":2200,"y":-30,"width":420,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"web","type":"text","text":"### React Web App\nall tenants · themed per tenant","x":750,"y":-1140,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"android","type":"text","text":"### React Native\nAndroid app","x":1120,"y":-1140,"width":330,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"gw","type":"text","text":"## API Gateway\nSpring Cloud Gateway\nrouting · JWT validation · **per-tenant rate limits** · CORS · request-id","x":820,"y":-890,"width":420,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"bffw","type":"text","text":"**BFF — Web**\n_(optional)_","x":1280,"y":-890,"width":260,"height":100},
